        <mxCell id="p2-207" value="ROUTING CHECKPOINTS" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=15;fontColor=#17343D;strokeColor=#BCD0D5;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;fontColor=#80989F;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="1032" width="1800" height="32" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2-208" value="• Public LB → Spoke CIDR phải trỏ FW, không trỏ thẳng DRG.&lt;br&gt;• att-hub gắn rt-hub-from-drg ở phần VCN route table.&lt;br&gt;• DRG from-hub: 10.1.0.0/16 → att-oe01.&lt;br&gt;• DRG from-spoke: 0.0.0.0/0 → att-hub." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=15;fontColor=#17343D;strokeColor=#BCD0D5;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontColor=#17343D;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="70" y="1070" width="850" height="115" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2-209" value="• Không import direct routes spoke → spoke gây bypass.&lt;br&gt;• FW→Hub LB dùng local routing, tránh loop về chính FW.&lt;br&gt;• Thêm OE02: routes + firewall policy + kiểm thử cả hai chiều.&lt;br&gt;• Packet trong cùng Spoke dùng NSG / NetworkPolicy." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=15;fontColor=#17343D;strokeColor=#BCD0D5;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontColor=#17343D;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="990" y="1070" width="850" height="115" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
